    "s1": {"x": 2460, "y": 0, "w": 360, "text": "Two levels: Projects, then one workspace with three destinations — Chat · Spec · Beads.\n\nChat is the verb: work is asked for in chat. Spec and Beads are the nouns: they show the truth and let you point.\n\nOwner decisions arrive as cards bound to one exact action and revision; nacred carries them out.\n\nStop, cancel, retry and recovery stay as direct controls in the work inspector.", "fill": "teal", "size": "m"}
